## 8. Non‑Functional Requirements
| Aspect | Spec |
| --- | --- |
| Performance | Initial render < 150 ms (10 k rows), scroll jank < 16 ms frame |
| Security | No eval; sanitized props; supply chain scanning (Snyk) |
| Browser Support | Evergreen (Chrome ≥ 110, Edge ≥ 110, Firefox ≥ 110, Safari ≥ 16) |
| Accessibility | WCAG 2.1 AA |
| Internationalization | Unicode / RTL ready; locale props for numbers & dates |
| Documentation | Versioned site, dark‑mode, search, code snippets in TS & JS |

