## 10. Risks & Mitigations
| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Scope creep vs. bundle size | Med | High | Strict module boundaries; tree‑shaking tests |
| Competing libraries release similar “easy + headless” approach | Med | Med | Focus on DX polish & performance benchmarks; marketing |
| Maintenance bandwidth | Med | High | Recruit OSS contributors early; sponsorship tier for sustainability |
| Virtualization edge cases (dynamic row height) | Low | Med | Provide fallback “fixed height” mode; doc caveats |

